Dear Applicants,

We are writing to inform you of a policy revision regarding indirect cost rates for the FY2026 Community Development Grant program.

CHANGE: Indirect Cost Rate Cap
- Previous: Up to 15% of total direct costs
- Revised: Up to 12% of total direct costs

This change is effective immediately and applies to all applications in preparation for the current cycle. The adjustment aligns with the Foundation's updated cost policy aimed at maximizing direct program investment.

Please recalculate your budgets accordingly. Note that this change, combined with the previously announced ceiling revision ($82,500), may require adjustments to your proposed program scope.

If you have questions, contact Dr. Amara Okafor at a.okafor@fieldstone-fdn.org.

Best regards,
